{"aggregate_id": "01KW8MSQ183M0QQWT5J2P55TRF", "aggregate_type": "Mission", "event_id": "01KW8MSQVY2395961D9JD62B1N", "event_type": "MissionCreated", "payload": {"created_at": "2026-06-29T02:54:37.610689+00:00", "friendly_name": "Atomic in-place inbox finalize", "mission_id": "01KW8MSQ183M0QQWT5J2P55TRF", "mission_number": null, "mission_slug": "finalize-inbox-file-01KW8MSQ", "mission_type": "software-dev", "purpose_context": "On 2026-05-18 the felix-admin-capture agent's inline Edit to write 'status: processed' failed silently (file 0644, agent needed group write); the note was left unprocessed for five days with no orchestrator detection. Per Constitution Directive 6 (deterministic work belongs in helper scripts), this mission folds an atomic, idempotent, error-surfacing finalize into the existing scripts/inbox/mark_processed.py and points the felix-admin-capture Step-5 standing orders at it. Finalize happens in place: the note keeps status:processed and stays in 01-Inbox/ for the 7-day retention window; prescan.py owns the eventual archive. Detectability comes from the atomic status write plus a 0/1/2 exit-code contract.", "purpose_tldr": "Make the inbox post-routing finalize a single atomic, idempotent, error-surfacing call by hardening mark_processed.py, replacing the agent's fragile inline frontmatter edit.", "target_branch": "feat/finalize-inbox-file-v2", "wp_count": 0}, "project_slug": "kg-automation", "project_uuid": "2c011d09-8272-470c-b9e2-e9ccf8ad3fbd", "schema_version": "5.0.0", "timestamp": "2026-06-29T02:54:38.462499+00:00"}
